@baseUrl = http://localhost:5049
@token = replace-with-a-valid-access-token
@leadId = 1

### Search visible leads by name, email, phone, city, state or status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leads?search=Austin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List visible leads (owner only; administrators see all)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leads
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Read an accessible lead
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leads/{{leadId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create (AppUserId and CreatedOn are assigned server-side)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/leads
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "statusId": 1,
  "phoneNumber": "555-0100",
  "firstName": "Sample",
  "lastName": "Lead",
  "email": "sample@example.test",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-05-20",
  "streetAddress": "100 Example Street",
  "city": "Austin",
  "state": "TX",
  "postalCode": "78701",
  "haveSpouse": "No",
  "spouseName": null,
  "spouseDateOfBirth": null,
  "currentAutoCarrier": "Example carrier",
  "anyLaspse": "No",
  "makeAndModel": "Example sedan",
  "accidents": "None",
  "tikets": "None",
  "homeOwner": "No",
  "hopeType": null,
  "haveHomeClaims": null,
  "currentHomeCarrier": null,
  "anyClaimInPast3Years": null
}

### Update (ownership and creation time are preserved)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/leads/{{leadId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "statusId": 1,
  "phoneNumber": "555-0101",
  "firstName": "Updated",
  "lastName": "Lead",
  "email": "sample@example.test",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-05-20",
  "streetAddress": "100 Example Street",
  "state": "TX",
  "haveSpouse": "No",
  "currentAutoCarrier": "Example carrier",
  "anyLaspse": "No",
  "makeAndModel": "Example sedan",
  "accidents": "None",
  "tikets": "None",
  "homeOwner": "No"
}

### Permanently delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/leads/{{leadId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Validation failure (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/leads
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Missing or inaccessible lead (404; other owners receive the same response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leads/2147483647
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Authentication required (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leads
